                Both reach 12% incline and carry 300 lb. The TLX adds a 20 by 60-inch belt instead of 18 by 55, a 12 mph top speed instead of 10, and a 7-inch LCD, for about $200 more on proform.com on 13 October 2026. Buy the TLX if you will jog or run; the TLS suits walkers who need the smaller footprint.
