                ProForm lists 2.6 CHP and footnotes it as a laboratory dynamometer rating that does not denote operational horsepower in household use. A Scheels listing repeats it, but one independent source checked for our ProForm roundup quoted a different rating, so we treat 2.6 CHP as ProForm’s figure rather than confirmed.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
